<view class="collection-page history-page">
  <view class="collection-hero">
    <view class="collection-hero-top"><view class="collection-mark">↺</view><text class="collection-edition">PERSONAL INDEX / 02</text><view wx:if="{{count > 0}}" class="collection-clear" hover-class="btn-hover" bindtap="onClearAll">清空记录 <text>↗</text></view></view>
    <text class="collection-kicker">TRACES OF YOUR DAY</text><view class="collection-title-row"><text class="collection-title">使用记录</text><text class="collection-num">{{countText}}</text></view>
    <text class="collection-desc">最近用过的工具，都在这里留下一枚轻轻的书签。</text>
    <view class="collection-footline"><text class="collection-local-dot"></text><text>只保存在这台设备</text><view></view><text>不上传服务器</text></view>
    <view class="collection-hero-orb"></view>
  </view>

  <view wx:if="{{!loading && count === 0}}" class="collection-empty"><view class="empty-bookmark history-empty-mark"><text>↺</text></view><text class="empty-kicker">A LITTLE ARCHIVE</text><text class="state-title">还没有足迹</text><text class="state-desc">用过的工具会自动留在这里。下次回来，就能从刚才的地方继续。</text><view class="empty-action" hover-class="btn-hover" bindtap="onGoTools">去工具架逛逛 <text>↗</text></view></view>

  <view wx:else class="collection-list hist-list">
    <view class="list-heading"><view><text class="list-kicker">YOUR RECENT TRACES</text><text class="list-title">刚刚走过的路</text></view><text class="list-count">{{count}} <text>ITEMS</text></text></view>
    <view wx:for="{{list}}" wx:key="id" class="collection-item hist-item {{item.alive ? '' : 'item-unavailable'}}" data-id="{{item.id}}" hover-class="collection-item-hover" bindtap="onItemTap">
      <image wx:if="{{item.image}}" class="item-art hist-image" src="{{item.image}}" mode="aspectFill"/><view wx:else class="item-art item-icon hist-icon" style="background:{{item.soft}};color:{{item.color}}">{{item.icon}}</view>
      <view class="item-spine history-spine"><text>↺</text></view>
      <view class="item-body hist-body"><view class="item-overline"><text class="item-category">{{item.categoryName || '使用过的工具'}}</text><text wx:if="{{!item.alive}}" class="item-status">已下架</text></view><text class="item-name hist-name ellipsis">{{item.name}}</text><text class="item-desc hist-desc ellipsis-2">{{item.desc}}</text><view class="item-meta"><text class="item-time">{{item.timeText || '最近使用'}}</text><text class="item-open">再用一次 ↗</text></view></view>
      <view class="item-remove hist-remove" hover-class="btn-hover" catchtap="onRemove" data-id="{{item.id}}"><text>移除</text><text class="remove-cross">×</text></view>
    </view>
    <view wx:if="{{count > 0}}" class="collection-end"><view></view><text>共 {{count}} 条最近足迹</text><view></view></view>
  </view>
  <view class="safe-bottom"></view>
</view>
